{"unit_id":"tag:07A9:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节汇集考虑 Ext 函子（functors）时出现的各种谱序列（spectral sequences）。对任意一对复形（complexes）<MATH_0001>，为复形（complexes），由模（modules）组成且位于赋环位点（ringed site）<MATH_0002> 上的，记\n<MATH_0003>，\n遵循《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》第 <REF_0001> 节的一般约定。\n\n","allowed_english":["Ext"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"spectral sequences","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"Ext 函子"},{"source_term":"spectral sequences","target_term":"谱序列","context":"本节汇集的谱序列"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"一对模复形；保留原文重复的 complexes 表述"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"复形的各项"},{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"引用章节标题"}],"notes":["原文 For any pair of complexes ... of complexes of modules 重复 complexes 字样，照实保留，不据此添加双复形的数学断言。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:07AA:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为上有界（bounded above）的复形（complex），由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成。设 <MATH_0004> 为 <MATH_0005>-模（module）。则存在谱序列（spectral sequence），其 <MATH_0006>-页（page）为\n<MATH_0007>，\n以及另一个谱序列（spectral sequence），其 <MATH_0008>-页（page）为\n<MATH_0009>。\n为构造这些谱序列（spectral sequences），选取内射（injective）消解（resolution）<MATH_0010>，并考虑两个谱序列（spectral sequences），来自双复形（double complex）<MATH_0011> 的，见《同调（Homology）》第 <REF_0001> 节。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"page","target_term":"页"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"page","target_term":"页"},{"source_term":"spectral sequences","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"消解"},{"source_term":"spectral sequences","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"double complex","target_term":"双复形"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界","context":"第一个复形的有界性"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"上有界系数复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"复形的各项"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"第二个系数模"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列","context":"两种 Ext 谱序列"},{"source_term":"page","target_term":"页","context":"谱序列指定的页"},{"source_term":"spectral sequences","target_term":"谱序列","context":"由双复形构造的谱序列"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"消解的内射性"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"消解","context":"系数模的内射消解"},{"source_term":"double complex","target_term":"双复形","context":"构造两种谱序列的双复形"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调","context":"引用章节标题"}],"notes":[]}
