{"unit_id":"tag:0FPJ:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为对象（objects），属于 <MATH_0003> 的。令 <MATH_0004>。此情形中的（全局（global））杯积（product）为映射（map）\n<MATH_0005>，\n位于 <MATH_0006> 中。将它定义为相对杯积（relative cup product），对于赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）\n<MATH_0007>，\n如注记 <REF_0001> 所述。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n下面表述并证明相对杯积（relative cup product）的一种自然相容性（compatibility）。具体而言，假设有态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>，在赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）之间。设 <MATH_0009> 和 <MATH_0010> 为复形（complexes），由 <MATH_0011>-模（modules）组成。存在朴素（naive）杯积（product）\n<MATH_0012>。\n断言它与相对杯积（relative cup product）有关。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"global","target_term":"全局"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"杯积"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积"},{"source_term":"compatibility","target_term":"相容性"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"naive","target_term":"朴素"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"杯积"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"导出范畴中的对象"},{"source_term":"global","target_term":"全局","context":"杯积的全局版本"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"杯积","context":"由 cup 限定的杯积"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"杯积映射"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积","context":"位点态射的相对杯积"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"定义全局杯积的态射"},{"source_term":"compatibility","target_term":"相容性","context":"朴素杯积与相对杯积的相容性"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"两赋环拓扑斯之间的态射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"态射的两端"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"朴素杯积的输入复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"输入复形的系数"},{"source_term":"naive","target_term":"朴素","context":"复形层面杯积的限定"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPK:statement","translation":"在上面的情形中，下图（diagram）交换（commutes）\n<MATHSEG_0001>注记 <MATHSEG_0002>朴素（naive）杯积（product）<MATHSEG_0003>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"naive","target_term":"朴素"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"杯积"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"杯积比较图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"该图的交换性"},{"source_term":"naive","target_term":"朴素","context":"验证过的向下箭头下标文字"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"杯积","context":"数学文字中的 cup product"}],"notes":[]}
